    "body": "## ZB Foundation Integration\n\nImplements the approved Foundation Integration contour only.\n\n- Approved PLAN #108 HEAD: `54d915d6138cb2cdc805bda44d70091d53c1da1b`\n- Execution base protected `main`: `0b9b77a9d82f45e7e1821dd6c9c26861a90cf688`\n- Exact candidate HEAD: `a1ad3e3a86d043544fb2900aa5f2d9faecefa7ad`\n- Fresh full local regression: `198 passed in 1.12s`\n\n### Included\n- pinned Foundation provenance manifest\n- validated controller single-instance lock\n- controller daemon lifecycle / health / preflight\n- Windows Task Scheduler deployment tooling\n- Reference Bridge contracts, validation, journal, publisher, runtime, health, CLI and deployment tooling\n- compatibility/regression tests preserving current controller behavior\n\n### Authority boundaries\n- `agent-controller/src/zb_local_controller/controller.py` unchanged from protected main\n- `agent-controller/src/zb_local_controller/task_contract.py` unchanged from protected main\n- current legal task kind remains `PRODUCTION_IMAGE_EDIT`\n- historical `CANON_REFERENCE_EDIT` is explicitly rejected by regression coverage, not restored\n- no canon/model/profile import\n- no logical-role communication routing / orchestrator core\n- no PR #103 mutation and no issue #102 proof copying\n- no production activation\n- no canon change\n- no OWNER LOCK\n- no auto-merge\n\n### Deferred\nOrchestrator Core and Remote Proof are deliberately deferred until the Foundation gate is accepted.\n\nDo not merge automatically. OWNER merge remains a separate explicit decision.",
